    "body": "> A big part of the proposal was writing up https://github.com/whatwg/html/wiki/dialog--initial-focus,-a-proposal#improving-conformance-requirements-and-examples as spec text, to replace the current single sentence \"The [dialog](https://whatpr.org/html/8199/interactive-elements.html#the-dialog-element) element represents a part of an application that a user interacts with to perform a task, for example a dialog box, inspector, or window.\"\r\n\r\nAh thanks, I totally missed this. It is now in the PR",
